WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:37.583
In verse 13.22,

2
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:40.625
Lord Krishna had explained that the jivatma,

3
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.708
although pure and spiritual as a soul,

4
00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:47.333
experiences good and bad births
when it associates

5
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:51.083
with the three gunas of prakriti,

6
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:55.083
sattva, rajas, and tamas.

7
00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:58.000
Now, in Chapter 14,

8
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.666
Lord Krishna explains the nature

9
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.916
of these three gunas in detail,

10
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:05.208
how they bind the soul,

11
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:08.750
and what the path to rise above them is.

12
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.625
He begins this chapter

13
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.625
by calling this knowledge param,

14
00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:17.250
the highest and most profound wisdom,

15
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.291
which has led sages and seekers to liberation.

16
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:26.916
Lord Krishna says,

17
00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.458
'I will once again impart to you

18
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:30.583
this supreme knowledge,

19
00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:34.125
the most profound of all wisdom.'

20
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:36.750
Here He indicates

21
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.708
that although He has given

22
00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:41.833
spiritual knowledge before, but

23
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:44.041
He is now presenting an even deeper

24
00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:46.208
insight.

25
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:49.000
This knowledge is called uttama,

26
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.041
the highest, because it makes clear
the workings of prakriti

27
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:53.375
and its three gunas,

28
00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:56.625
sattva, rajas, and tamas,

29
00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:58.791
and also how the soul

30
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:01.375
can rise above them.

31
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:04.500
He further says, 'Through understanding
this knowledge,

32
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.750
all the sages attained param siddhi,

33
00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.500
This means that seekers

34
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.916
who understand and apply this knowledge

35
00:02:12.916 --> 00:02:15.916
in life cross material bondage

36
00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:19.375
and attain supreme peace and liberation.

37
00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:22.791
This verse underlines

38
00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:26.583
that knowing the relationship between
the soul and the three gunas

39
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:29.666
is not merely theoretical understanding,

40
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:32.333
it is practical guidance

41
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.750
that can free the seeker

42
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.250
from the world's bondage

43
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.500
and lead them to the Paramatma.

44
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Have you ever thought while

45
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.541
helping someone,

46
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:53.666
'Am I doing this so people think

47
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:56.666
I am wise, or because

48
00:02:56.666 --> 00:03:01.208
I truly care?'

49
00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:05.083
When I spoke this verse to Arjun,

50
00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:08.916
he had not asked a new question.

51
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:12.916
Yet I felt, there is still more to be said.

52
00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:16.708
Not to impress,

53
00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:20.083
but to lift him higher.

54
00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:23.000
This is what true care is.

55
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.333
When you genuinely care for someone,

56
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:27.500
you do not wait

57
00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.708
only for them

58
00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:31.958
to ask.

59
00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.875
You recognise the need

60
00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:39.000
hidden within their words,

61
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.625
you sense what support

62
00:03:41.625 --> 00:03:45.541
they truly need,

63
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:48.041
and then you give what

64
00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:51.583
can truly change their life.

65
00:03:51.583 --> 00:03:55.291
Helping a person in need

66
00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:58.750
with money or clothing

67
00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.666
is undoubtedly a noble act.

68
00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:03.750
But posting

69
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:09.708
a photograph of that moment on social media,

70
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:13.875
is that not a rather ugly display

71
00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:17.791
of the person's poverty

72
00:04:17.791 --> 00:04:21.875
and your own desire to appear

73
00:04:21.875 --> 00:04:24.166
great?

74
00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:27.041
The purpose of knowledge is not to display

75
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:30.125
the mind's spiritual development,

76
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:33.250
it is to transform the heart.

77
00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.958
So the next time

78
00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:38.208
you guide someone,

79
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:40.375
ask yourself,

80
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:42.125
'Am I here only

81
00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:45.333
to appear wise,

82
00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:50.333
or do I truly wish to serve them?'

83
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:52.625
Because true knowledge

84
00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:55.833
flows not from ego,

85
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:57.625
but from love.

86
00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:04.500
Every family wants

87
00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.416
to give the next generation its best.

88
00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:11.750
We work hard, make plans,

89
00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.000
and try to pass on

90
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.250
what we believe will be beneficial,

91
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.000
a way of life, values, or a way of thinking.

92
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.666
But consider this,

93
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:26.125
are we also giving them the knowledge

94
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:27.333
that

95
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:31.416
 can free them from life's deeper problems?

96
00:05:31.416 --> 00:05:33.000
Or are we,

97
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.041
without realising it,

98
00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:35.333
preparing them

99
00:05:35.333 --> 00:05:38.166
for the next stage of the same cycle?

100
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.500
The highest knowledge is not only

101
00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.750
for succeeding in this life.

102
00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:49.333
It is for understanding who we are,

103
00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:51.666
and why we keep getting caught

104
00:05:51.666 --> 00:05:55.750
in the cycle of birth and death again and again.

105
00:05:55.750 --> 00:06:00.541
This knowledge is what lifts us
above every sorrow.

106
00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:04.416
So ask yourself,

107
00:06:04.416 --> 00:06:08.666
what are your children learning from you?

108
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:10.750
Are you giving them knowledge

109
00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.958
that will set them free,

110
00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:17.125
or are you pulling them into yet another cycle

111
00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:21.375
that binds them to the material race?

112
00:06:21.375 --> 00:06:25.458
Bring this knowledge of the Gita into your home,

113
00:06:25.458 --> 00:06:28.583
and see how it transforms

114
00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:32.500
the very purpose of your family.

115
00:06:37.166 --> 00:06:43.250
At the workplace, you often share
your knowledge

116
00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.458
with junior colleagues, teammates,

117
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:50.083
or even clients.

118
00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:54.250
But pause for a moment and ask,

119
00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.083
why do you share it?

120
00:06:57.083 --> 00:07:01.875
Only to appear knowledgeable,

121
00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:06.750
or because you truly wish to help them?

122
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.208
When I began

123
00:07:08.208 --> 00:07:12.583
explaining the gunas of prakriti to Arjun,

124
00:07:12.583 --> 00:07:15.250
he had not asked Me anything.

125
00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:19.666
But I knew this knowledge

126
00:07:19.666 --> 00:07:23.625
would not only help him understand,

127
00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:25.541
it would also help him rise above

128
00:07:25.541 --> 00:07:27.791
the confusion

129
00:07:27.791 --> 00:07:30.375
in which he was caught.

130
00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:33.708
Understand, the purpose of sharing knowledge

131
00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:37.625
at the workplace should be just this,

132
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:40.250
not to impress,

133
00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.375
but to lift others up.

134
00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:47.041
Whether you are guiding someone,

135
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:50.208
leading a team, or simply

136
00:07:50.208 --> 00:07:55.125
answering a colleague's doubt,

137
00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:58.583
your intention matters.

138
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:02.916
Ask yourself, is your guidance

139
00:08:02.916 --> 00:08:05.875
making the other person more confident,

140
00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:10.000
more aware, more capable?

141
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:15.125
Or is it making them more dependent on you?

142
00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:16.916
True leadership

143
00:08:16.916 --> 00:08:19.958
is not about holding on to knowledge,

144
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:24.000
it is about passing it on with care

145
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.333
and responsibility.

146
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:30.375
Remember, the finest leadership,

147
00:08:30.375 --> 00:08:34.125
like that of a good teacher,

148
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:35.083
genuinely

149
00:08:35.083 --> 00:08:39.041
wants to see others move forward,

150
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:41.583
even if it means

151
00:08:41.583 --> 00:08:44.625
they sometimes go beyond you.

152
00:08:44.625 --> 00:08:46.833
Let your words

153
00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:49.125
educate them.

154
00:08:49.125 --> 00:08:53.875
Let your guidance lift them up,

155
00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:55.916
and let your presence

156
00:08:55.916 --> 00:08:58.833
empower them.

157
00:08:58.833 --> 00:09:04.541
This is what makes knowledge truly
a force of change.
